About **1,070 words now**. Cuts remove about **90 words**; the two needed clarifications add about **30**. Moving the arrest and release changes placement, not length. Target: roughly **1,010 words**.

## Decision

The two categorical detention claims are Critical against the page’s own DHS record. The incomplete early sequence and missing sides of the split are Major. The cuts make room for the necessary corrections.

